Scenario "terminal_scrollback"
Command "andiron-fixture"
Terminal rows 3 cols 12
Cursor row 3 col 1

Step "show prompt on the bottom row"
WaitFrontendLineStartsWith "maqi>" timeout 5000ms
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |············|
  r01 |············|
  r02 |maqi>·······|

Step "print more logical lines than the screen height"
Paste "111111\n222222\n333333\n444444"
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |...>·222222·|
  r01 |...>·333333·|
  r02 |...>·444444·|

Step "append at the bottom margin"
Input "X"
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |...>·333333·|
  r01 |...>·444444X|
  r02 |············|

Step "scroll back to the original input"
Scroll up 2
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |maqi>·111111|
  r01 |...>·222222·|
  r02 |...>·333333·|

Step "return to live output"
Scroll down 2
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |...>·333333·|
  r01 |...>·444444X|
  r02 |············|

Step "continue typing without duplicating earlier lines"
Input "YZ"
Settle 0ms
Expect:
  r00 |...>·333333·|
  r01 |...>·444444X|
  r02 |YZ··········|
